"id":"40b231c3-f62d-5b39-867f-bab4540578c7"},{"text":"Most awarded real estate company in the history of Dubai","strapi_id":1099,"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/check_cricle_af038a8557.svg"},"id":"91570f2f-febd-58bc-9471-19519ffbe119"},{"text":"Transparent Transactions","strapi_id":1100,"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/check_cricle_af038a8557.svg"},"id":"db98558f-a0b4-543f-93e9-c5a294e2881a"},{"text":"360 real estate services","strapi_id":1101,"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/check_cricle_af038a8557.svg"},"id":"1575c644-186d-5251-be7b-795cf325cd43"}],"bg_color":null,"image_fit":null,"style":null},{"id":"de932a84-7dfc-53ce-9649-70e4173b3c77","name":"Helena Abrimovich","strapi_id":16,"strapi_component":"modules.review-banner","review":"“I had an excellent experience working with Nora for my first real estate investment in Dubai. She was knowledgeable, professional.”","date":"April 11, 2024","image":null},{"id":"e3cf6fc7-8dcb-5b0e-92a9-66aee38ea594","title":"Frequently Asked Questions","strapi_id":40,"strapi_component":"modules.faq","cta_text":null,"bg_color":null,"faqs":[{"strapi_id":661,"question":"What is the timeframe for commission payout? ","id":"9b0f4f2a-6ce0-5ff9-8955-c13af3e09571","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Commission payout is subject to several variables. The two primary factors to consider are:</p><ul><li>Whether it pertains to an off-plan or secondary market deal.</li><li>The chosen developer by the investor.</li></ul>"}}},{"strapi_id":662,"question":"Can you guarantee the confidentiality of my clients' personal information?","id":"8ade4b94-a9a8-545e-848f-f708dc8412c8","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Yes, we can provide a Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) when necessary, in addition to our referral contract with you. We prioritize confidentiality for all our clients and partners.</p>"}}},{"strapi_id":663,"question":"Will I receive updates on new property launches in Dubai?","id":"73c3a56f-a3f5-5086-b200-314ff3478550","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Upon becoming an official partner with Zoya Ventures Real Estate, you will receive launch updates from our marketing department. Additionally, your account manager will communicate any projects or properties deemed suitable for your clientele.</p>"}}},{"strapi_id":664,"question":"Can my clients list their property for sale with you?","id":"4e5eeae6-aa9d-5308-b76a-0e8acc913355","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Yes, they can. We boast one of the most experienced listing and secondary market teams in Dubai to ensure that your client receives top-tier service, guaranteeing the successful sale of their property.</p>"}}},{"strapi_id":665,"question":"Do you have access to real estate in other emirates?","id":"dd1787d5-3344-5589-a0d3-9ed45fb3d5c4","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Yes, we do. We maintain access to developers across all emirates, as well as partnerships with other real estate brokerages, ensuring our ability to source the perfect property for your client.</p>"}}},{"strapi_id":666,"question":"Is it possible to negotiate a higher commission rate?","id":"bcea8458-2148-554d-a338-5890d7683df2","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>If you are partnering with us and possess extensive knowledge, enabling you to qualify the client, then we can certainly discuss the possibility of a higher commission rate.</p>"}}}]},{"id":"0f79b467-f6c0-54bb-a599-93f1ad6363a5","title":"Elevate Your Success with Our Partner Program","content":{"data":{"content":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Need information on our services or assistance? Fill out the form, and we’ll respond promptly to address your queries.</span></p>"}},"stats":[],"form":"Partner_Program","strapi_component":"modules.form-module","strapi_id":10,"show_contact":true,"cta":null,"icon_stats":[]}]}},"pageContext":{"page_id":"a2e97817-dd5f-5438-997f-7082f2956e8e"}},"staticQueryHashes":["